                <p>Not printed in full, see <hi rendition="#italic">ante</hi>
                    <ref target="#pg401">p. 401</ref>; summarizes information received on conditions
                    in other parts of Russia.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d454-f2" n="2" xml:id="d454-f2-content">
                <p> John K. Caldwell, Consul at Vladivostok.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d454-f3" n="3" xml:id="d454-f3-content">
                <p> Hugh Moran, representative of the Y. M. C. A. in Siberia.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
